## 🚀 How to View & Run

1. **Clone or Download** this repository:
   ```bash
   git clone https://github.com/<your-username>/<your-repo-name>.git
   ```
2. Open **`Project_2_Dashboard_Completed_2.xlsx`** in **Microsoft Excel (Microsoft 365 or Excel 2021+)** to support dynamic array formulas (`UNIQUE`, `SORT`, `TAKE`).
3. If prompted with a security banner for external/dynamic formulas, click **Enable Editing** and ensure **Formulas → Calculation Options → Automatic** is active.
